          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga gali mena gakuyicisya ga Alefi ŵaŵatamaga mu msinda wa Yelusalemu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.14+1CH.9.15+1CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.14",
              "1CH.9.15",
              "1CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Alonda ŵa ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE ku Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.14+1CH.9.15+1CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.14",
              "1CH.9.15",
              "1CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alonda ŵakuyicisyaŵa ŵatamaga ku Yelusalemu: Shalumu, Akubu, Talimoni ni Ahimani. Shalumu ni juŵaliji mlongola jwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpaka mu ndaŵi jelejo ŵandu ŵa lukosyolu ŵaŵisile kuti alondeleje pa cipata ca kungopoko lyuŵa kwa nyumba ja mwenye. Jemanjaji kalakala ŵaliji alonda ŵa pa yipata ya masakasa ga Alefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu, mwanace jwa Kole, cisukulu ca Ebiyasafu pampepe ni ŵandu ŵane ŵa liŵasa lya Kola, ŵalondelaga pa Cipata ca Nyumba ja AMBUJE, mpela muŵalondelaga acinangolo ŵawo pa Cipata ca Tenti ja Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Finihasi mwanace jwa Eliyesa ni ŵaliji mkwalamulila, ligongo AMBUJE ŵaliji ni jwalakwejo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
